So, okay, we're having, oh wait.

182
00:07:03,660 --> 00:07:05,740
I'm sorry, I have to talk to this person over here.

183
00:07:06,180 --> 00:07:12,120
When you want to come back to what you were talking about, you want to return to the topic, you say, as I was saying.

184
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:12,880
That's right.

185
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,340
As I was saying.

186
00:07:14,580 --> 00:07:23,810
So, maybe you were interrupted, maybe you got distracted and you want to continue talking about the same topic as I was saying and then you continue talking.

187
00:07:23,910 --> 00:07:26,930
So, you return to the original point you are making.

188
00:07:27,130 --> 00:07:28,170
Okay, very good.

189
