228
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:19,320
I've noticed.

229
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:22,560
You're one of the last people to come in in the morning.

230
00:09:22,800 --> 00:09:28,460
Yeah, usually for work, I arrive late but not like too late.

231
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:32,240
Some people may even be an hour or two or something.

232
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:34,580
A couple minutes, 15 minutes is all right.

233
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:37,180
But I do hate to wait.

234
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:47,690
If we agree to meet up at 2 o'clock and you come in at 2.30, I don't know, let's say to the movies, then I think that's really irritating.

235
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:48,690
I agree.

236
00:09:48,950 --> 00:09:57,530
I'm a very punctual person and I get very annoyed when people are late to meetings or when people come late to appointments or parties.

237
00:09:58,870 --> 00:10:06,970
And I think it's different in different countries because in many different places, they have what they call the local time.

238
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:25,720
So if you say, okay, the meeting is at 9, then everyone assumes that the meeting is supposed to start at 9 but then everyone comes in at 9 but grabs a cup of coffee, talks at the cooler, gets their seat, checks their email and then the meeting will start at 9.30 instead of 9.

239
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:26,720
Right.

240
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:31,320
